--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a re-implementation of the open-source parts of
https://github.com/Happyrobot33/HNode (MIT). The VRSL grid node itself is a
separate paid product by AcChosen and is NOT included or copied here.

The build downloads two third-party SDKs, which carry their own licences:

- Steinberg VST3 SDK        - sdk/vst3sdk     (Steinberg SDK licence)
- Spout2 (Lynn Jarvis)      - sdk/spout2      (BSD 2-clause)

Neither is vendored in this repository. Run `build\fetch-sdk.bat` once after
cloning to fetch them.
